    "about": {
      "description": "VecCore is a simple abstraction layer on top of other vectorization libraries. It provides an\narchitecture-independent API for expressing vector operations on data. Code written with this API can\nthen be dispatched to one of several backends implemented using libraries like Vc, UME::SIMD, or a\nscalar implementation.",
